      {
        "name": "Async/Await Pattern",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "All async operations use await. Top-level main() async function with proper entry point pattern. No .then()/.catch() chains or callback-based patterns in the main logic."
      },
      {
        "name": "Pagination with for-await-of",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "listByResourceGroup() result is iterated with 'for await (const account of storageAccounts)', correctly using PagedAsyncIterableIterator without collecting into an array."
      },
      {
        "name": "LRO Pattern (beginXxx + pollUntilDone)",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Uses beginCreateAndWait() which is the recommended convenience method that internally calls beginCreateOrUpdate and polls until done."
